  "body": "## What changed\n\nUpdate the `detect_holes` row in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\nDocument the `{ operation, holes, radial_holes, skipped, status }` reply shape, the Bore-op core filter (`d + 4 * reach + 2 * stock_to_leave`), the `skipped` sentences, and the all-too-wide Bore refusal (`no hole this Bore op can make: ...`) that stores nothing.\nAlso note external-Thread boss detection, lathe/mill-turn radial cross holes, and the single undo step.\nAdd `docs/decisions/1584-detect-holes-skipped-skill.md` to record keeping the PR docs-only.\nLeave `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` untouched so the merging session bumps it and announces on `#681`.\n\n## Cause\n\nPR #1575 (#1556) added `skipped` and the Bore-op refusal to `detect_holes`, and `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` already describes it, but `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` did not yet list `skipped` or the Bore-op refusal.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pinning check (`grep -E '^- \\`detect_holes .*\\`skipped\\`.*refused.*stores nothing' .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`): exited 1 before the fix, exited 0 after the edit.\n- Mutation check: restoring `upstream/main:.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` exited 1, and restoring the edit exited 0.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`changed since upstream/main (4a0ba90): 2 file(s)`, `nothing in crates/ changed: no tests to run`, `0 step(s), 0 failed`).\n- `git diff --check upstream/main`: clean.\n- Verified row details against `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`, `crates/app/src/mcp/edit.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/material.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/bore_reach.rs`, `crates/motion/src/machining2d/bore_core.rs`, and `crates/app/tests/bore_core.rs`.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo live MCP session or Rust test binary ran because this PR edits documentation only.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #1695 touches `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` at a different section (adds rows after `set_part_axes`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nEffort: low\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1584\n",
